 (-9,\\infty )=[\\frac{1}{4},\\frac{10}{3})\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x\\in [\\frac{1}{4},\\frac{10}{3}),$ which can also be written as $\\frac{1}{4}\\le x<\\frac{10}{3}.$" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282338 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282339 13194139534207 true] [17592186282338 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282340 13194139534207 true] [17592186282338 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282341 13194139534207 true] [17592186282338 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282342 13194139534207 true] [17592186282338 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282343 13194139534207 true] [17592186282338 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534207 true] [17592186282338 1041 "selection" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282338 1104 #edb/ref 17592186282339 13194139534207 true] [17592186282338 1110 #uuid "d998cfb9-0a42-5a47-a253-d11873c550e6" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282339 1034 "\\frac{1}{4}\\le x<\\frac{10}{3}" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282339 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534207 true] [17592186282339 1111 #uuid "2c8f2d68-d93f-5798-8f58-d89d9338fac0" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282340 1034 "x\\ge \\frac{1}{4}" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282340 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534207 true] [17592186282340 1111 #uuid "2277e36e-12ff-5d9b-a15c-bb29ccf26b80" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282341 1034 "x>-9" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282341 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534207 true] [17592186282341 1111 #uuid "9c4c6e18-a0c0-556e-8020-4736d98443e1" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282342 1034 "-9<x\\le \\frac{1}{4}" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282342 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534207 true] [17592186282342 1111 #uuid "3ffdf6c2-b95b-5a30-a5ef-aa909c380f0b" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282343 1034 "x<\\frac{10}{3}" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282343 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534207 true] [17592186282343 1111 #uuid "609117d3-b93e-58af-a207-81c5202a5c60" 13194139534207 true] [17592186282344 1017 #edb/ref 17592186282345 13194139534207 true] [17592186282344 1017 #edb/ref 17592186282347 131